      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تجوّر</span></b>  <i>He became prostrated;</i> (S;) <i>he fell
down;</i> (K;) by reason of a blow. (S, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<i>It</i> (a building, TA) <i>became thrown down,</i> or
<i>demolished.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He</i> (a man, TA) <i>laid himself down on his side</i> (K) upon his bed. (TA.)

